"text": "[image] Always appreciate the chance to visit with our local Chamber of Commerce leaders who made the trip to Boise. Chambers are often the first call for small businesses and employers as they navigate growth, workforce challenges, and regulations. I value the perspective they bring and the work they do back home in Idaho Falls.",
