"text": "[image] It was an honor to spend Cenarrusa Day on the Hill with Idaho FFA students and Mrs. Cenarrusa. This day honors Pete Cenarrusa, who served Idaho as both a longtime state legislator and later as Secretary of State, and who believed in teaching young people how government works. FFA’s foundation in agriculture goes hand-in-hand with developing leadership and a strong sense of civic responsibility.",
